and sovereign recovery operations.

\subsection{System Overview}
The TCE models the hair-follicle lifecycle using a hybrid dynamical
system composed of:
\begin{itemize}
    \item continuous vitality dynamics $F(t)$,
    \item discrete biological phases $\sigma(t)\in\{A,C,T\}$,
    \item stochastic forcing $\Delta S(t)$,
    \item sovereign supervisory kernel $\mathcal{P}_{\text{sov}}$.
\end{itemize}

